{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "五种放法",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 114.96,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.687
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "私钥是一个 256 位的随机数，用来给交易签名。",
   "spoken": "私钥是一个 256 位的随机数，用来给交易签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.1,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 3.1,
   "speechEnd": 7.712
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "谁能让私钥签一笔交易，谁就拥有这笔资产。",
   "spoken": "谁能让私钥签一笔交易，谁就拥有这笔资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 8.12,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 8.12,
   "speechEnd": 11.998
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "助记词是 12 或 24 个单词，可以推导出一组私钥。",
   "spoken": "助记词是 12 或 24 个单词，可以推导出一组私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 12.42,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 12.42,
   "speechEnd": 17.269
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "放私钥的方法，常见的有五种。",
   "spoken": "放私钥的方法，常见的有五种。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 17.68,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 17.68,
   "speechEnd": 20.265
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "第一种，助记词软件钱包，私钥在手机、电脑或浏览器扩展里。",
   "spoken": "第一种，助记词软件钱包，私钥在手机、电脑或浏览器扩展里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 20.7,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 20.7,
   "speechEnd": 26.181
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "设备被攻破，钱就没了。",
   "spoken": "设备被攻破，钱就没了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 26.6,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 26.6,
   "speechEnd": 28.84
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "第二种，硬件钱包，私钥在一块独立芯片里，不离开设备。",
   "spoken": "第二种，硬件钱包，私钥在一块独立芯片里，不离开设备。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 29.22,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 29.313,
   "speechEnd": 34.274
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "它只负责签名，签之前，人要看清签的是什么。",
   "spoken": "它只负责签名，签之前，人要看清签的是什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 34.72,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 34.72,
   "speechEnd": 38.823
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "第三种，多签，比如 Safe，几个独立私钥加一个链上合约。",
   "spoken": "第三种，多签，比如 Safe，几个独立私钥加一个链上合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 39.26,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 39.26,
   "speechEnd": 44.783
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "签名数达到门槛，交易才执行。",
   "spoken": "签名数达到门槛，交易才执行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 45.24,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 45.24,
   "speechEnd": 47.634
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "第四种，MPC 门限签名，私钥被切成几个分片。",
   "spoken": "第四种，MPC 门限签名，私钥被切成几个分片。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 48.1,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 48.1,
   "speechEnd": 52.752
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "几方各自计算，合成一个普通签名，完整私钥从不出现。",
   "spoken": "几方各自计算，合成一个普通签名，完整私钥从不出现。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 53.2,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 53.294,
   "speechEnd": 58.413
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "第五种，HSM，私钥锁在专用硬件里，不能导出。",
   "spoken": "第五种，HSM，私钥锁在专用硬件里，不能导出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 58.86,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 58.86,
   "speechEnd": 63.343
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "它只按指令签名，不判断指令对不对。",
   "spoken": "它只按指令签名，不判断指令对不对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 63.72,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 63.72,
   "speechEnd": 66.792
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "签名人看不懂签的内容就签，叫盲签。",
   "spoken": "签名人看不懂签的内容就签，叫盲签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 67.22,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 67.22,
   "speechEnd": 70.726
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "软件钱包和 HSM，盲签风险最高。",
   "spoken": "软件钱包和 HSM，盲签风险最高。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 71.12,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 71.214,
   "speechEnd": 74.77
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "多签的门槛写在链上，谁都能查，MPC 在链上只是一个普通地址。",
   "spoken": "多签的门槛写在链上，谁都能查，MPC 在链上只是一个普通地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
   "start": 75.18,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 75.279,
   "speechEnd": 80.564
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "打个比方，私钥是保险柜的钥匙。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，私钥是保险柜的钥匙。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-18.wav",
   "start": 81.0,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 81.096,
   "speechEnd": 84.242
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "多签像一个柜子三把锁，要两把一起开。",
   "spoken": "多签像一个柜子三把锁，要两把一起开。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-19.wav",
   "start": 84.66,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 84.756,
   "speechEnd": 89.049
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "可如果锁的主人看同一块屏幕，三把锁就退化成一把。",
   "spoken": "可如果锁的主人看同一块屏幕，三把锁就退化成一把。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-20.wav",
   "start": 89.44,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 89.44,
   "speechEnd": 94.134
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "比喻不成立的地方是，真实的钥匙被复制，会留下痕迹。",
   "spoken": "比喻不成立的地方是，真实的钥匙被复制，会留下痕迹。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-21.wav",
   "start": 94.54,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 94.54,
   "speechEnd": 99.163
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-22",
   "text": "私钥被复制，不留任何痕迹，直到资产被转走，你才知道。",
   "spoken": "私钥被复制，不留任何痕迹，直到资产被转走，你才知道。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-22.wav",
   "start": 99.64,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 99.64,
   "speechEnd": 104.435
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-23",
   "text": "所以方案的强度，取决于最容易被攻破的那个环节。",
   "spoken": "所以方案的强度，取决于最容易被攻破的那个环节。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-23.wav",
   "start": 104.9,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 104.9,
   "speechEnd": 108.862
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-24",
   "text": "一台设备，一行日志，一个签名人的眼睛。",
   "spoken": "一台设备，一航日志，一个签名人的眼睛。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-24.wav",
   "start": 109.28,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 109.373,
   "speechEnd": 113.534
  }
